WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:35.770
How was your audience with Her Highness Najayra?

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.370
That voice!

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.530
I'm afraid I've been neglecting you.

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:42.890
Quinza...

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.820
Why didn't you come before?

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.430
I beg your pardon, but...

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:48.980
some privacy?

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.180
Where do you get off, telling us--

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.290
Toranosuke...

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:53.930
do as he says...

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:55.750
Let's go, Toranosuke.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:03.370
"Uncontrollable Feeling"

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.960
I've never seen you dressed like that before.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.280
I barely recognized you.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.040
Only those tied to the Royal Palace are permitted traditional dress.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:17.670
I don't like this, but it's too conspicuous otherwise.

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:19.730
Quinza...

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:23.710
I thought you would always put Rumaty first.

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:26.360
Of course I do.

00:02:26.510 --> 00:02:29.010
Then why? Why are you serving Somand?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.640
It's the "royal family" that I serve.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:34.950
Just because His Highness Rumaty is not here...

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:37.930
it doesn't mean I get to stop following orders.

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.920
However...

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:42.430
with regard to His Highness' recent kidnapping...

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.880
I blame myself. I missed it.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.490
You're telling me you're Somand's chamberlain...

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:48.120
and they didn't let you know about it?

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.340
It was entirely the work of the Head Chamberlain and his faction.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.600
And it isn't in His Highness to defy them.

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:57.070
From now on, though...

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.560
I won't let anyone make a fool of me!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:04.070
Quinza...

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.370
Miss Kajika...

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.420
Is it really true that His Highness escaped without injury?

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.760
What...

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:17.010
what is that look in your eyes, Quinza?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.820
I don't know all the details, either.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:24.590
If Rumaty had been hurt, though...

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:28.280
whatever the obstacles in his path, Lee-Leng would let me know.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.310
Of course.

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:32.050
Quinza...

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.280
what are you planning to do?

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.910
You value Rumaty above all else...

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.680
maybe more than the "royal family..."

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:44.680
No... as far as you're concerned...

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.540
he <i>is</i> the royal family, isn't he?

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.260
I'm afraid I'm out of time.

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.180
I must be going.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.480
Quinza, wait...

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.020
Aren't you going to go with us to America?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:00.400
You're supposed to be by Rumaty's side.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:03.720
I appreciate the offer...

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.490
but that is impossible.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:10.400
I have no intention of leaving the country.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.360
My duty is to this land.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.800
Please give my regards to His Highness Rumaty.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:20.080
Someday I will bring him back to the Royal Palace.

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:24.380
The new dawn is not that far away...

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.390
If you'll excuse me, then.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.000
Quinza...

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:41.120
It's true.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.950
I'm protecting the nation.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:44.610
For my country's sake...

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:50.150
I'll betray my friends, deceive my family and shed the blood of my countrymen...

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.990
A revolution requires a sacrifice.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.040
When the tide of history is changing...

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.300
the times demand blood.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:01.160
Only then...

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.470
will the time come for my Prince to ascend to the throne!

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.220
For the birth...

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.560
of our true King!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.440
Welcome home, Master Carl.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.050
Nice to see you, Ervick.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.960
The master has been waiting for you.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.040
I'll just go and inform him of your arrival.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.380
Well, lookee here!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:27.730
If it isn't Carl!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.700
It's been <i>such</i> a long time.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.050
I thought you were never coming home to Texas!

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:35.570
And they appear...

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:37.460
Hell's Three Sisters.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:39.800
You don't call, you don't write...

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:43.000
It's almost like you're avoiding us!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:45.430
Now look, big sisters...

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:48.160
you all know how busy I am.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.700
The only thing you're good at is making excuses.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.530
Like mother, like son, I guess.

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:54.710
That's going too far, Lisabelle...

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:59.630
Oh, my! So I shouldn't say that a nightclub woman must know how to pay lip service?

00:05:59.760 --> 00:06:01.560
Stop that, now...

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:04.370
just because Carl's mother was a "hostess" ...

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:05.720
That's right...

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:08.830
he may only be half-, but he is our brother, right?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.850
Isabelle...

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.850
did things go south...

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:17.020
with that so-called "singer?"

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.480
and Lisabelle...

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:22.630
looks like those bills are really starting to pile up...

00:06:23.890 --> 00:06:24.790
Marie-Belle...

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.850
how go the divorce proceedings?

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:30.280
Well!

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.790
If it's too much for you to handle, sisters...

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.030
before Dad finds out...

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:36.550
I'll do something about it.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.780
So by all means, don't hold back.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.310
If you'll excuse me, then.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:53.950
How could we ever...

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:57.320
have assembled a group of stupider, more good-for-nothing women?

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.840
My mother is who she is.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:01.430
Blinded by greed...

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.320
she agreed to marry a man 30 years her senior.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:07.060
If they were going to divorce after just a year...

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.980
they should never have had me!

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:13.790
The way my "sisters" tormented me after that...!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.350
Even my becoming claustrophobic...

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:21.500
Oh, no...

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.300
I feel an attack coming on...

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.850
Not here...

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:35.380
I can't let them see my weakness...

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.400
That's okay...

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:40.700
Let your body do what it wants.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.420
It's okay... Look...

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:49.740
Master Carl!

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:51.050
Another attack?

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.680
Ervick...

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:54.810
It's okay.  I'm better.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:56.560
My word!

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:59.020
You've recovered completely...

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.630
The warning signs came...

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:03.180
but no attack.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.750
I've never had the pleasure of seeing that happen!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:06.950
Indeed...

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.890
When I remembered Kajika...

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:11.980
I suddenly felt better.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:15.070
It's like the words became a hypnotic suggestion.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:17.990
What is the matter?

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:20.200
I was surprised to be called back so suddenly.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:24.180
I've been getting some disturbing reports...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.060
How do things stand with Izmal?

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:28.800
Right.

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:31.140
He's perfectly willing...

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.550
to serve as our backup plan.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:36.000
What's happening with Najayra?

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:37.910
That situation...

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.980
is proceeding nicely for us.

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:42.380
Currently, her attention is focused...

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.030
on Kajika Burnsworth.

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:48.550
Najayra is openly hostile towards Kajika.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:50.920
If she does hate Kajika,

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.700
there's no telling what she might do...

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.080
Hm...

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:57.570
like keep Rumaty's rights from being restored... for example?

00:08:58.310 --> 00:08:59.200
Yes.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.070
It's entirely possible.

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:03.460
Use her wisely.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:04.770
So far...

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:07.410
with the the failure of our man Husak...

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.700
and the assassins turning on each other...

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:13.460
everyone we've dealt with has been completely useless.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:17.350
As for Somand, I hear he's stopped showing up even for official business.

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:21.320
Do everything in your power to prepare the way for the crowning of Izmal.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.160
Yes, sir.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.340
You must stay focused to the bitter end.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:29.520
Even if Izmal is crowned, there could be a major plot twist coming.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.480
A plot twist?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:37.050
Regarding the birth of Harry Burnsworth.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:39.580
His birth!?

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:42.000
For the last fifteen years...

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:45.510
I've pursued this investigation at great expense.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.300
Depending on the result...

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:52.070
I may have to alter the strategy for my Rosenthal Foundation, as well.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:54.340
You're saying Chairman Burnsworth's birth...

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:56.620
is somehow connected to the Kingdom of Raginei?

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:58.960
Incidentally...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:03.340
I hear you and Kajika Burnsworth have become quite close.

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.320
What? "Close?"

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:07.520
We've only met twice!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.530
Well enough...

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.630
if it cures you of your aversion to women.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.640
It's not like my idiot daughters...

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.640
are going to provide me with a worthy heir.

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.570
Master Lee-Leng...

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.990
are you awake?

00:10:32.760 --> 00:10:35.010
What's the matter? You seem flustered...

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:36.960
Master Tonsen, from Singapore, he's...

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:38.960
Uncle Tonsen?

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.050
Step aside.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:45.040
Lee-Leng.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.460
Why, hello, Uncle.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:49.820
If you had let me know you were arriving...

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.470
I could have picked you up from the airport.

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.530
In your condition?

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:57.280
If my very own uncle is coming...

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:58.740
what does a little boo-boo matter?

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:01.010
I wouldn't call it "little" ...

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.980
I'd say that the leader of the Huang...

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.930
had been shot.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.930
You're well-informed.

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:11.350
Do you know what they're saying in the streets?

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:15.140
"When did the Huang become Burnsworth's errand boys?"

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:16.910
Uncle...

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:20.500
While it's true that I am serving as Kajika's chaperone...

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:22.810
it's a private matter.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:25.820
There are advantages for the Huang, though.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:30.020
Right now, Burnsworth has all the power of a rising dragon.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.330
The Huang business will absorb that energy...

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.820
and be enhanced by it in the process.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:41.100
Let the gossips say what they like...

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.320
we should be proud to provoke so much jealousy.

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:50.190
You sound...

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.340
exactly like your father.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:57.610
Your father, Cho-i Huang, had just the same way of looking down on people.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:59.630
He ignored our protests...

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:02.260
and gave you a Western-style education.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.860
And what did we get back?  A detestable...

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:09.010
imitation Anglo-Saxon!

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:12.350
You don't even know to respect your elders!

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:16.860
I intend...

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:21.910
to behave in the way that best serves our family all around the globe.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:26.530
At times that behavior may not satisfy the older generation.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:33.030
You are uneasy about my youth and inexperience, and I appreciate your concern, Uncle.

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:38.570
But while I may be your nephew, I am also the leader of the Huang.

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:41.990
If I at times sound impertinent...

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.020
you will have to pardon me.

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:45.980
Hm.

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:48.070
Karma will get you for those words, Lee-Leng.

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:50.900
Better take good care of that injury...

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.660
if you can't bend over in your condition...

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:57.400
it'll be hard to lick Burnsworth's feet.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.090
Zao!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.040
Excuse me, Uncle...

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:04.220
Please wait a moment.

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:05.880
There's one more thing.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.300
Please cut ties with Rosenthal.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:11.960
What!?

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:15.460
As long as the man at the top is motivated by personal feelings...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.720
Rosenthal has no future.

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:20.600
I'm asking this as head of the Huang.

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:21.840
Don't make me...

00:13:21.970 --> 00:13:25.750
have to start interfering in your business.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.820
Is that... an order?

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:32.630
It is the family's will.

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:35.840
How dare you...!

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:37.520
To my face...!

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:40.240
You'll regret this, Lee-Leng.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.310
That's too much! What a way to act!

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:50.210
He may be an elder, but even rudeness has limits!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.560
Control yourself, Zao.

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:55.020
I can't say I don't understand how my uncle feels.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:57.380
Master Lee-Leng.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:04.190
Hey! Open up!

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:05.950
Your Highness?

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.700
How long have you been out there?

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:11.710
About ten minutes.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.930
I'll be going, then, Lee-Leng.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:19.070
Man, but you can put up with a lot.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.850
That guy had me about to kick the door down.

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:23.260
Huh...

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.800
If I had, though...

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:27.340
I thought you'd be in an even worse position...

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:28.560
so I stopped.

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:30.820
I'm very glad to hear it.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.420
Will it be okay?

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.790
Elders have a lot of authority, don't they?

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.500
He came here to trip you up.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.190
Your Highness...

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:43.090
My uncle publicly opposes me.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.270
Charming traits like that are why...

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.510
I find his personality so lovable.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:51.470
A true enemy...

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:54.170
pretends to be on your side.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.550
Enemies like that, I won't go easy on.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.730
Those like my uncle...

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:02.580
can even come in handy, to flush the other kind out of hiding.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.450
So you have him in the palm of your hand...

00:15:05.690 --> 00:15:07.500
A relative, thirty years older than you...

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:09.400
You...

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:11.130
you really are a scary guy.

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:12.710
Sorry.

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.990
Still, Your Highness...

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.060
Knowing how to tell your friends from your enemies...

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:22.080
will be indispensable in the political world you're about to find yourself in.

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:25.010
First-class politicians...

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:29.530
can see through to someone's true nature intuitively.

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.770
Beyond that are the even more elite...

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:36.090
What kind of people are they?

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:40.740
People who are capable of turning their enemies into their friends.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:49.950
You said before...

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.370
that Raginei stands at a crossroads...

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:55.780
and that what it needs is a strong leader.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:57.710
In other words...

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:00.840
are you telling me to become a hyper-elite politician?

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:03.900
You don't want to lose your country, do you?

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:06.520
Do I have what it takes?

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.000
Before the Kingdom of Raginei is destroyed...

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:11.130
can I become that kind of politician...?

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:13.170
can I become... King?

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.960
Don't ask, "Can it happen?" ...Your Highness.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:19.800
Ask yourself, "How can I make it happen?"

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.160
Big brother...

00:16:24.640 --> 00:16:25.650
somewhere inside of you...

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:28.490
you're already living as if you're supposed to be removed.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:31.900
I won't tell Your Highness what to think.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:36.680
That's something you must answer for yourself.

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:39.990
Mm-hmm.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:47.260
Some part of me still believes...

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:51.940
that my brother loves me...

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:56.210
even though I already know it's a fantasy.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:00.350
What Lee-Leng says is true...

00:17:00.980 --> 00:17:03.500
but I can't quite grasp it yet.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:06.920
Whatever this feeling is...

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.970
I know if Kajika were here she'd make sense of it for me.

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.710
Kajika... I want to see you...

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:18.060
I want to go home to Raginei...

00:17:23.860 --> 00:17:25.230
Miss Kajika!

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:28.060
Permission came through for the private plane to take off!

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:29.470
Really?

00:17:30.830 --> 00:17:33.600
But Najayra was blocking us...

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:35.900
Maybe it was Quinza...

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.820
Quinza...

00:17:37.860 --> 00:17:40.260
doesn't know you want to go home, does he?

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.830
Someone with more power than Najayra...?

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:47.160
What did you say?!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:49.530
Kajika left for America?

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:51.240
By what means?

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.290
My deepest apologies...

00:17:53.610 --> 00:17:56.980
It seems a government official applied pressure on their behalf...

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:59.350
Government? Who was it?

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.220
Who was the brainless fool?

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.820
It's okay...

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:06.990
whoever it was, they'll pay for it.

00:18:07.370 --> 00:18:09.090
They'll learn that those who defy me...

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:12.440
will not be suffered to live on the land of Ragi!

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:15.470
Najayra.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.100
Father...

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.410
Extinguish your anger.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.380
You are the heir to the Chadli family line of mediums.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.950
In such a state you cannot hear the voice of God clearly.

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:31.480
And if I did distort the voice of God, what then?

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:35.460
Has an oracle that passed through me ever once failed to come true?

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:38.870
Everyone here recognizes your talent.

00:18:39.360 --> 00:18:41.450
But when it comes to Miss Kajika...

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.970
don't you feel your tranquility suffers slightly?

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:47.440
I hate her! Don't try to reason with me.

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:50.890
I've told you before, someday you may have no choice but to...

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:52.950
clasp hands with her in friendship.

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:54.960
Clasp hands?

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.250
Don't be ridiculous!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.640
Najayra...

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.760
I'm the one who authorized take-off.

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:05.530
Knowing you were the one interfering...

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.920
Prime Minister Kayate came to ask me for a favor.

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:11.480
If it were only his own request, I wouldn't have budged.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.280
What do you mean?

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.110
Although he was defying royalty, Kayate didn't hesitate.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.350
Which means, in other words...

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:25.480
The order must have come from someone who outranks you entirely.

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:28.070
Father...

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:30.700
you can't mean... but that...

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.330
His Majesty Machaty's Throne of God.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.260
Why... would my grandfather...?

00:19:55.230 --> 00:19:56.400
Lee-Leng!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.410
I was worried!

00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.210
We couldn't get in touch with you...

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.430
That's what I was going to say!

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:04.290
How is your shoulder?

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.270
It's nothing, really. I'm fine.

00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:09.690
Oh, let me see.

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:12.180
H--hey!

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:13.230
Kajika!

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.590
--Hurry up!
--H--hey!

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:15.450
Stop it!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.560
I said hurry and take it off!

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.210
S--stop it Kajika!

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:33.280
What did you do that for?

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:36.410
This will make my position on the estate...

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:38.680
extremely delicate.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:41.770
When they hear how I knocked you off your feet?

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.560
Hilarious!

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:47.020
Not funny, Kajika. Not funny.

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:51.000
So you were shot while trying to save Rumaty?

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.900
That boy... he can be pretty rash...

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.450
Well, we'll be paying attention this time.

00:20:56.850 --> 00:21:00.690
Since it happened, though, Rumaty has actually become much more sensible.

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.820
It's a case of good coming from bad.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:06.840
Kajika!

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.450
Rumaty!

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.510
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:11.180
You, too.

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.230
Let me get a good look at your face.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:21.620
I'm glad...

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:25.060
Your eyes are calm.

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.310
I thought they might be even more stormy...

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.980
I also heard you've been bonding with Lee-Leng.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.710
Well, how about it?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.410
How would you say it's going, Your Highness?

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:43.280
All he does is treat me like a plaything.

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:45.780
Because he's a playful, cruel fox.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.580
That's pretty severe...

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:53.370
You definitely bonded.

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:56.810
There's a world of difference from the other day.

00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.590
It's just because I owe him my life.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:01.730
I can't help it.

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:03.220
You still...

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:06.500
have that "can't help it" attitude?

00:22:06.960 --> 00:22:08.920
What are you trying to say?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:13.170
Ah... hey, wait, Rumaty!

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:15.100
--Don't bug me.
--Hey, c'mon, wait!

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:21.980
You haven't fixed the short temper, then.

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:24.590
You really enjoy making fun of people.

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:27.650
You and Lee-Leng becoming friends...

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:29.340
made me really happy to hear.

00:22:31.540 --> 00:22:32.930
But, um...

00:22:33.470 --> 00:22:34.590
the truth is...

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:41.630
Something happened that I wasn't sure I should tell you about.

00:22:42.890 --> 00:22:43.950
What?

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:47.280
I thought I could tell you if it was the "new you."

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:49.560
So I'll tell you.

00:22:54.090 --> 00:22:56.100
I saw Quinza.

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
